<title>FRANCE: Four die in helicopter crash in southern France.</title>
<headline>Four die in helicopter crash in southern France.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four people died when a helicopter air-ambulance crashed near the southern French city of Carcassonne on Friday evening, local government officials said on Saturday.</p>
<p>They said the cause of the accident was being investigated.</p>
</text>
